OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 19 JAN
OL,4,G2100FThe Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
OL,5,     GJames Hunter joins Cerys to play
OL,6,     Gsome of his favourite blues
OL,7,     Grecords and tells us about The
OL,8,     GJames Hunter Six's new album Off
OL,9,     GThe Fence.
OL,10,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,11,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,12,     Ggroove. 'Dr. Beat' is also on
OL,13,     Ghand to prescribe a perfect tune
OL,14,     Gfor a listener whose week hasn't
OL,15,     Ggot off to the best start!
OL,16,G0000FOJ Borg
OL,17,     GOJ is live through the night from
OL,18,     Gthe Salford Riviera with Midnight
OL,19,     GMastermind, Wish You Were There
OL,20,     Gand the first Midnight Caller of
OL,21,     Gthe week.
